
Bundled dashboard components
=============================
The static/ dashboard assets include the following npm packages and
build-generated runtime helpers. Versions below correspond to the actual
rendered modules. Paths are relative to this JAR. Original copyright and
full license texts are preserved at the indicated package-local locations.
For dompurify the Apache-2.0 alternative is selected.

