Embedded portions within the dashboard dependencies
--------------------------------------------------
ApiDOM 1.12.0 contains modified json-schema-ref-parser URL utilities,
graphql-js visitor code and deepmerge algorithms, under MIT in addition
to the Apache-2.0 modifications. See licenses/LICENSE-apidom-embedded
for the original notices, copyright holders and MIT license text.

The RFC 6901 ABNF grammar in @swaggerexpert/json-pointer 2.10.2 is
BSD-2-Clause. See licenses/LICENSE-ietf-json-pointer and the original
licenses/NOTICE-@swaggerexpert-json-pointer.

ECharts' copied d3 quantile implementation is BSD-3-Clause.
See licenses/LICENSE-echarts-d3.

fast-json-patch's copied fast-deep-equal implementation is MIT.
See licenses/LICENSE-fast-deep-equal.

The Node.js path code and MarkedJS portions in monaco-editor are MIT.
See licenses/NOTICE-monaco-editor for the original complete notices and terms.
